    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22190" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γίγας</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αντος</span>, ὁ</span>, mostly in pl., <u>Giants</u>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
